    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "North America's foremost tribute to CCR returns to perform the greatest hits of Creedence Clearwater Revival.\r\nOne of the most entertaining acts on the theatre circuit, Green River Revival includes virtuoso musician Rick Spyder on the fiddle and saxophone. This show sells fast so book now to hear Bad Moon Rising, Proud Mary, Susie Q, Have You Ever Seen The Rain, Midnight Special, Fortunate Son and many more classics! "
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Le plus grand groupe hommage à CCR d'Amérique du Nord revient pour interpréter les plus grands succès de Creedence Clearwater Revival.\r\nL’un des spectacles les plus divertissants du circuit théâtral, Green River Revival compte dans ses rangs le musicien virtuose Rick Spyder au violon et au saxophone. Les billets se vendent rapidement alors réservez dès maintenant pour réentendre des chansons incontournables comme Bad Moon Rising, Proud Mary, Susie Q, Have You Ever Seen The Rain, Midnight Special, Fortunate Son, entre autres. "
      }
    ],
