        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience the Magic of The Nutcracker\r\nThe Academy of Classical Ballet & Modern Dances (ABCDM) proudly returns to the historic Capitol Theatre with its acclaimed production of The Nutcracker - a treasured holiday tradition in Moncton since 2011.\r\nStep into a world of enchantment as this timeless holiday masterpiece comes to life with breathtaking artistry. From dazzling costumes and beautifully crafted sets to exquisite choreography, every detail is designed to transport audiences into Clara’s magical journey.\r\nThis spectacular production features over 100 outstanding local dancers and artists, joined by special guest performers from the renowned Les Grands Ballets Canadiens, bringing world-class excellence to the stage.\r\nThe experience is elevated even further with a live performance by the acclaimed Tutta Musica Orchestra, conducted by Maestro Antonio Delgado, delivering Tchaikovsky’s iconic score with richness, power, and elegance.\r\nA truly unforgettable celebration of the season, The Nutcracker is a dazzling holiday event for audiences of all ages.\r\nChildren under two are welcome to attend this performance and will not require a ticket if they are seated on an adult's lap. "
