        "@value": "Dufflebag Theatre - Capitol Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Want to join the bravest crew in all of France to protect the King? Young country lad d’Artagnan sure does, and he has trained his whole life to become a Musketeer. But he discovers it's not so simple in DuffleBag Theatre’s adaptation of the timeless Alexandre Dumas adventure! Upon his arrival in ..."
      },
