        "@value": "After more than three decades in the spotlight, beloved entertainer Patrice L’Écuyer finally steps onto the stage alone for the very first time with his debut one-man show, Après seulement 32 ans d’absence sur scène. Best known for his sharp comedic timing and long-running presence in Québec ..."
