        "@value": "Every morning, we wake up with the same goal: to make our lives grand. We dream about it, we exhaust ourselves chasing it, we lose ourselves along the way, we stumble, we get back up and sometimes, just for a fleeting moment, we actually get there. And in that instant, everything suddenly makes ..."
