    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Anticipation"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Anticipation"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience the beautiful songs, stories behind the music, and love story of two of the 1970s’ most iconic singer-songwriters: Carly Simon and James Taylor!\r\nThis intimate show brings their legendary songs and heartfelt story to life, featuring classics like You’re So Vain, Fire and Rain, Mockingbird, How Sweet It Is, and of course Anticipation.\r\nFeaturing singer-songwriter Daisy Progosh (guitar, piano, vocals), David Skolnick (guitar, piano, vocals), Danny Zaidman (guitar, vocals), Mike Wark (saxophone, flute), Adam Kurgatnikov (bass), and Aaron Spink (drums, vocals). "
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Découvrez les magnifiques chansons, les histoires qui se cachent derrière la musique et l’histoire d’amour de deux des auteurs-compositeurs-interprètes les plus emblématiques des années 1970 : Carly Simon et James Taylor!\r\nCe spectacle intimiste donne vie à leurs chansons légendaires et à leur histoire émouvante, avec des classiques tels que You’re So Vain, Fire and Rain, Mockingbird, How Sweet It Is et, bien sûr, Anticipation.\r\nAvec la chanteuse et compositrice Daisy Progosh (guitare, piano, voix), David Skolnick (guitare, piano, voix), Danny Zaidman (guitare, voix), Mike Wark (saxophone, flûte), Adam Kurgatnikov (basse) et Aaron Spink (batterie, voix). "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
